    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355400/extras/9eee16437d76c3928d9b25fddbc790b2.avif?t=1716487007\" /></div><br><strong>The Line</strong> is a unique experiment in the field of 3D puzzles. <br><br>You control the ball and have to collect all targets on the level to complete it. Sounds easy? Yeah, but the trick is that your every movement leaves a trail behind you. If you touch it you lose. You have to jump, dash and control your speed to find a perfect path that will let you finish the level. But one mistake and you'll start from the beginning. Think, analyze and be quick then you'll succeed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique gameplay</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">30 levels with brain blowing puzzles</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Each level can be solved in dozens ways</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use interactive environment to solve puzzles</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fancy graphics with neon style</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nice sfx and energetic music</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Keep track of your game stats</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Regular updates with new levels</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><strong>Test your logic and savvy with this unusual puzzle game! Good luck!</strong>",
